 he had formed.", "words": [[2, 53439], [6, 53577], [10, 53677], [15, 53917], [19, 54257], [27, 54797], [29, 54997], [36, 55317], [45, 55997], [48, 56177], [54, 57011], [58, 57138], [64, 57398], [67, 57558], [71, 57738], [75, 57918], [79, 58238], [84, 58438], [87, 58618], [91, 58778]]}, {"verse": 9, "start": 59768, "end": 70950, "text": "And out of the ground made the LORD God to grow every tree that is pleasant to the sight, and good for food; the tree of life also in the midst of the garden, and the tree of knowledge of good and evil.", "words": [[0, 59768], [4, 59873], [8, 60053], [11, 60173], [15, 60253], [22, 60553], [27, 60833], [31, 60993], [36, 61253], [40, 61553], [43, 61773], [48, 61993], [54, 62333], [59, 62693], [64, 62913], [67, 63053], [76, 63393], [79, 63613], [83, 63713], [90, 64053], [94, 64493], [99, 64673], [103, 64873], [109, 65609], [113, 65689], [118, 65929], [121, 66089], [126, 66369], [131, 66889], [134, 67169], [138, 67249], [144, 67489], [147, 67689], [151, 67809], [159, 68569], [163, 68849], [167, 68969], [172, 69229], [175, 69349], [185, 69769], [188, 70029], [193, 70269], [197, 70409]]}, {"verse": 10, "start": 71300, "end": 78004, "text": "And a river went out of Eden to water the garden; and from there it was parted, and became into four heads.", "words": [[0, 71300], [4, 71446], [6, 71546], [12, 71786], [17, 72026], [21, 72246], [24, 72386], [29, 72666], [32, 72926], [38, 73206], [42, 73426], [50, 74187], [54, 74330], [59, 74510], [65, 74890], [68, 75130], [72, 75310], [80, 75890], [84, 76370], [91, 76690], [96, 76970], [101, 77290]]}, {"verse": 11, "start": 78354, "end": 84930, "text": "The name of the first is Pison: that is it which compasses the whole land of Havilah, where there is gold;", "words": [[0, 78354], [4, 78441], [9, 78701], [12, 78841], [16, 78961], [22, 79301], [25, 79816], [32, 80482], [37, 80782], [40, 80962], [43, 81062], [49, 81262], [59, 81902], [63, 82042], [69, 82282], [74, 82662], [77, 82822], [86, 83662], [92,